---
import SiteLayout from "../../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import pages from "../../../../data/pages.json";
import PageHeader from "../../../../components/PageHeader.astro";
import AccordionPanel from "../../../../components/AccordionPanel.astro";
const page = pages["/fr/equipe/david-abraham-delgado-aguinaga/"];
---
<SiteLayout page={page}>
<main class="site-main wpex-clr" id="main">
<PageHeader attributes={{"class": "page-header centered-page-header has-bg-image bg-fixed wpex-bg-fixed wpex-bg-cover wpex-bg-center wpex-bg-no-repeat wpex-relative wpex-mb-40 wpex-surface-2 wpex-py-30 wpex-border-t wpex-border-b wpex-border-solid wpex-border-surface-3 wpex-text-2 wpex-text-center wpex-supports-mods"}}>
<div class="page-header-inner container">
<div class="page-header-content">
<h1 class="page-header-title wpex-block wpex-m-0 wpex-text-5xl">
<span>DAVID ABRAHAM DELGADO AGUIÑAGA</span>
</h1>
</div></div>
</PageHeader>
<div class="container wpex-clr" id="content-wrap">
<div class="content-area wpex-clr" id="primary">
<div class="site-content wpex-clr" id="content">
<div class="wpex-first-mt-0 wpex-clr" id="single-blocks">
<article class="single-content wpex-mt-20 entry wpex-clr" id="staff-single-content"><div class="wpb-content-wrapper"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><figure class="vcex-image vcex-module"><div class="vcex-image-inner wpex-relative wpex-inline-block"><img alt="" class="vcex-image-img wpex-align-middle" decoding="async" height="613" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 613px) 100vw, 613px" src="/assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-david.png" srcset="/assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-david.png 613w, /assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-david-300x300.png 300w, /assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-david-150x150.png 150w" width="613" /></div></figure></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_text_column has-custom-color wpex-child-inherit-color wpb_content_element" style="color:#c3004f;letter-spacing:var(--wpex-tracking-widest);text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Collaborateur</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
<style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div><div class="vcex-module vcex-divider vcex-divider-solid vcex-divider-center wpex-mx-auto wpex-block wpex-h-0 wpex-border-b wpex-border-solid wpex-border-main" style="border-color:#ca0043;"></div><style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;"><span lang="ES-MX"><a href="mailto:david.delgado@camya.mx"><span style="font-family: &#x27;Arial&#x27;,sans-serif;">david.delgado@camya.mx</span></a></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Chez CAMYA, notre équipe réunit des avocats passionnés et spécialisés. Leur solide formation et la diversité de leurs expériences nous permettent de proposer des solutions juridiques innovantes. Nous nous engageons à être votre partenaire de confiance et à vous fournir des services de qualité qui dépassent les approches habituelles.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear"></div><div class="vc_tta-container" data-vc-action="collapseAll"><div class="vc_general vc_tta vc_tta-accordion vc_tta-color-grey vc_tta-style-flat vc_tta-shape-rounded vc_tta-o-shape-group vc_tta-controls-align-default vc_tta-o-no-fill vc_tta-o-all-clickable"><div class="vc_tta-panels-container"><div class="vc_tta-panels"><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1635384111206-b34a88f0-d17b1704251202366"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1635384111206-b34a88f0-d17b1704251202366"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Principaux domaines de pratique</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify;"><span lang="ES-MX" style="font-family: &#x27;Arial&#x27;,sans-serif;">Conseil et contentieux en droit civil et commercial, notamment en matière de responsabilité civile, de procédures collectives, d’exécution des titres de crédit, de successions et d’exécution des contrats civils et commerciaux.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1635384111327-a7daacc2-8fae1704251202366"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1635384111327-a7daacc2-8fae1704251202366"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Formation</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: justify;">Licence en droit (2021) de l'Universidad Panamericana.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Spécialité dans les institutions de droit commercial de l'Universidad Panamericana (2021).</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1635384111454-6cc92110-e55b1704251202366"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1635384111454-6cc92110-e55b1704251202366"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Parcours professionnel</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: justify;">Son parcours professionnel a débuté en rejoignant CAMYA Abogados en tant que stagiaire, puis en devenant avocat au sein du cabinet à partir de 2021.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1635384111607-9d90efed-f3121704251202366"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1635384111607-9d90efed-f3121704251202366"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Langues</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p>Espagnol et anglais.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
</div></article>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</main>
</SiteLayout>
